---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contato"
  description="Canais oficiais para conversar com o Laboratório Brasil."
>
  <article class="article">
    <span class="eyebrow">Contato</span>
    <h1>Vamos conversar.</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Sugestões, críticas, contrapontos e correções fazem parte do
      Laboratório Brasil.
    </p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Canais oficiais</h2>

      <p>
        Você pode acompanhar e conversar com o projeto pelos canais abaixo:
      </p>

      <div class="contact-socials">
        <a class="contact-social youtube" href="https://www.youtube.com/@labbrasillb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="social-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 0 0-2.1-2.1C19.5 3.6 12 3.6 12 3.6s-7.5 0-9.4.5A3 3 0 0 0 .5 6.2 31 31 0 0 0 0 12a31 31 0 0 0 .5 5.8 3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.1c1.9.5 9.4.5 9.4.5s7.5 0 9.4-.5a3 3 0 0 0 2.1-2.1A31 31 0 0 0 24 12a31 31 0 0 0-.5-5.8ZM9.6 15.6V8.4L15.8 12l-6.2 3.6Z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>
            <strong>YouTube</strong>
            <small>@labbrasillb</small>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="contact-social instagram" href="https://www.instagram.com/labbrasillb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="social-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" ry="5"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
              <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>
            <strong>Instagram</strong>
            <small>@labbrasillb</small>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="contact-social x-social" href="https://x.com/labbrasillb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="social-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23 22h-6.1l-4.8-6.3L6.6 22H3.5l7.1-8.1L3 2h6.3l4.3 5.7L18.9 2Zm-1.1 17.8h1.7L8.4 4.1H6.6l11.2 15.7Z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>
            <strong>X</strong>
            <small>@labbrasillb</small>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a class="contact-social github" href="https://github.com/labbrasillb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="social-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M12 .7a11.6 11.6 0 0 0-3.7 22.6c.6.1.8-.3.8-.6v-2.3c-3.3.7-4-1.4-4-1.4-.5-1.4-1.3-1.8-1.3-1.8-1.1-.7.1-.7.1-.7 1.2.1 1.8 1.2 1.8 1.2 1 1.8 2.8 1.3 3.5 1 .1-.8.4-1.3.8-1.6-2.7-.3-5.5-1.3-5.5-5.9 0-1.3.5-2.4 1.2-3.2-.1-.3-.5-1.5.1-3.2 0 0 1-.3 3.3 1.2a11.4 11.4 0 0 1 6 0c2.3-1.5 3.3-1.2 3.3-1.2.6 1.7.2 2.9.1 3.2.8.9 1.2 1.9 1.2 3.2 0 4.6-2.8 5.6-5.5 5.9.4.4.8 1.1.8 2.1v3.1c0 .3.2.7.8.6A11.6 11.6 0 0 0 12 .7Z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span>
            <strong>GitHub</strong>
            <small>@labbrasillb</small>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2>Críticas são bem-vindas</h2>

      <p>
        O Laboratório Brasil não trata propostas como verdades prontas.
        Se uma ideia publicada tiver uma falha, um efeito colateral ou uma
        premissa fraca, o contraponto faz parte do processo.
      </p>

      <p>
        Problema → hipótese → teste → crítica → revisão.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .contact-socials {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .contact-social {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    transition:
      transform 160ms ease,
      border-color 160ms ease;
  }

  .contact-social:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .contact-social > span:last-child {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .contact-social strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .contact-social small {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .social-icon {
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .social-icon svg {
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
  }

  .youtube .social-icon {
    color: #ff0000;
  }

  .youtube svg,
  .x-social svg,
  .github svg {
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  .instagram .social-icon {
    color: #e4405f;
  }

  .instagram svg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .x-social .social-icon {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .github .social-icon {
    color: #6e5494;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .contact-socials {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
